{"unit_id":"weshopai__weshop-dsh-plugin#card-zh","repo":"weshopai/weshop-dsh-plugin","commit":"45db655fc6e375061f3794966bd8d1e65db2149c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"WeShop for DeepSeek Harness 是面向 Web 客户端的电商视觉创作插件。它在 DSH 中加入与对话并排的无限画布，通过 Cordis 主机提供画布状态、素材和请求接口，并注册原生工具与 WeShop Skills。用户可导入图片、视频、音频和文本素材，管理多画布内容与多选项，引用当前选中素材发起对话，并将生成结果发布回画布；画布上下文菜单也能提交反推提示词、放大和局部编辑请求。生成任务通过 WeShop OpenAPI 执行。使用画布、浏览本地素材不需额外配置；生成 API 需配置 WeShop API Key，可在画布中设置或用 WESHOP_API_KEY。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:27-31","src/native-tools.js:130-140"]}
{"unit_id":"weshopai__weshop-dsh-plugin#card-en","repo":"weshopai/weshop-dsh-plugin","commit":"45db655fc6e375061f3794966bd8d1e65db2149c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"WeShop for DeepSeek Harness adds a DSH web canvas for product visuals. Users organize image, video, audio and text assets, reference selections in chat, and publish generated results to the canvas. Tools run WeShop OpenAPI tasks and queue image edits. API generation requires a WeShop key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:27-31","src/native-tools.js:130-140"]}
