{"unit_id":"weshopai__weshop-dsh-plugin#feature-14","repo":"weshopai/weshop-dsh-plugin","commit":"45db655fc6e375061f3794966bd8d1e65db2149c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"WeShop for DeepSeek Harness 的功能「并排无限画布」：在符合 WeShop preset 的会话中打开画布工作区和同步对话面板，并提供侧栏入口重新打开。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.jsx:112-120","src/client/index.jsx:155-180"]}
{"unit_id":"weshopai__weshop-dsh-plugin#feature-15","repo":"weshopai/weshop-dsh-plugin","commit":"45db655fc6e375061f3794966bd8d1e65db2149c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"WeShop for DeepSeek Harness 的功能「多媒体素材导入」：用户可通过文件选择或拖放导入图片、视频、音频及纯文本，素材加入画布并保存到本地桥接服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/CanvasWorkspace.jsx:504-542","src/client/CanvasWorkspace.jsx:555-560"]}
