{"unit_id":"weshopai__weshop-dsh-plugin#feature-17","repo":"weshopai/weshop-dsh-plugin","commit":"45db655fc6e375061f3794966bd8d1e65db2149c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"WeShop for DeepSeek Harness 的功能「调用 OpenAPI 生成」：原生工具接受 agent、参数和可选参考图，必要时先上传本地图片，再创建 WeShop run 并轮询任务状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/native-tools.js:56-100","src/native-tools.js:236-259","src/native-tools.js:303-310"]}
