{"unit_id":"weshopai__weshop-dsh-plugin#caveat-21","repo":"weshopai/weshop-dsh-plugin","commit":"45db655fc6e375061f3794966bd8d1e65db2149c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"WeShop for DeepSeek Harness 使用 OpenAPI 时会将 API Key 放入发往 openapi.weshop.ai 的 Authorization 请求头；本地参考图片也可能先上传到该服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/native-tools.js:41-48","src/native-tools.js:56-65"]}
{"unit_id":"weshopai__weshop-dsh-plugin#caveat-22","repo":"weshopai/weshop-dsh-plugin","commit":"45db655fc6e375061f3794966bd8d1e65db2149c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"WeShop for DeepSeek Harness 默认会在操作系统临时目录保存画布状态、请求、进度和上传素材；可用 WESHOP_STATE_FILE 等变量修改部分路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:33-44"]}
